message: "If you use this software in research or a clinical project, please cite it as below."
title: "Gait Analysis Markerless"
abstract: "A PyQt5 desktop application for markerless gait analysis from single-camera sagittal video using OpenPose, with signal preprocessing, pixel-to-meter scaling, manual leg-ID and gait-event correction, spatiotemporal parameter extraction, joint kinematics, and CSV/Excel reporting."
type: software
